* hr.gfxdriver, graphics.library's driver for the HR card, in the C900
* dialect of an Amiga fd file.  GetGfxDriver() is <graphics/gfxdriver.h>'s
* first function of a display driver.
##base _HRBase
##bias 30
##public
GetGfxDriver(fmts)(struct GfxDriver **) struct GfxDriver * @HR_5
##end
